## Affected versions

* Version 7.0.0 (last stable version as of March 2018) - previous
versions are probably also vulnerable but not tested


## Solution

Update to 7.0.2
([changelog](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr/develop/Ch=
angeLog))

